el.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Although some Beasts, such as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dxun Tomb Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dxun_Tomb_Beast"}," and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shyrack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shyrack","referenceId":"reference:6985214882b28c6f"},", are associated with specific locations, a Gamemaster need only change a Beast's name to use it anywhere he or she wants. For example, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dxun Tomb Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dxun_Tomb_Beast"}," could be renamed the \"Shadow Stalker\" and encountered in a ruin in the planet ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ossus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ossus","referenceId":"reference:8196389ed661366f"}," or anywhere else the Gamemaster wishes.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["BEAST\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["IMAGE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Battle Hydra"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battle_Hydra","referenceId":"reference:02637bbd99d0264f"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 8\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Beck-tori"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beck-tori","referenceId":"reference:2d23536aa1a1853b"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 12\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Chrysalis Rancor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Chrysalis_Rancor","referenceId":"reference:c3b8093b5434d56b"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 13\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Derriphan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Derr